        "KH-12"
      ],
      "state": "sourced",
      "notes": "The age the law itself labels \"the retirement age\" (s.3), read as the age that shortens the study-fund period to 3 years. Inference from the Ordinance's defined term (tax-hishtalmut.md open question 5; keren-hishtalmut.md open question 8)."
    },
